{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676990/extras/a456d034b170f3b5555bd84f6f1d88c6.avif?t=1709036988\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br>MusicLabelManager is a music industry simulator that allows players to create and run their own record label. Players take the role of CEO and try to make their mark on the music industry. The game has a database with more than 1000 real artists with stats for 2021. Music awards, singles, concert tours, streaming services and much more.  The best music tycoon on the market!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Six different music genres</strong> </h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676990/extras/739dd3b4c2d54fe01e7fa4807dbdab38.avif?t=1709036988\" width=500 height=152 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676990/extras/975ad0d04c038683ca47a03b13b2fe09.avif?t=1709036988\" width=500 height=152 /></span><br><br>Everyone is a challenge!<br><u>Hit the charts in any genre and claim a special award!</u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Manage every aspect of your growing business</strong> </h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676990/extras/021a3fa4625458217a6c7763cf531c05.avif?t=1709036988\" width=500 height=146 /></span><br><br>Create album, single and concert tour!<br><u>Collect points, open departments and also release mixteps, remixes of famous hits and concert stars!</u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Sign a contract with your favorite artist</strong> </h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676990/extras/d3007204858ff74ef215f455267a02d8.avif?t=1709036988\" width=500 he